METHODS OF PASSING VARIABLES:
============================================
variables can be passed through these methods:
- default value
CLI:
------------
- promted value in CLI
- pass it via CLI as -var
terraform plan -var="variablename=value"

ENV VARIABLE:
------------
- Input the value for a variable via system environment variable
export TF_VAR_<variableName>=<value>

verify using env command 
to unset,
unset TF_VAR_<variableName>

FILE:
------------
- How to supply the input values via file
terraform plan -var-file=<filename.tfvars>

AUTO-SUPPLY INPUTS VIA FILE:
------------------------------------
- how to auto supply the input values via file
create a file with the extension of auto.tfvars

